Modifications
-------------
All new code lives outside packages/. Summary of what was added:

  engine/     input-to-motion engine, its build, unit tests and end-to-end tests
  studio/     static demo (no bundler; vendor/ contains the prebuilt IIFE bundle)
  scripts/    dependency-free static server and demo asset sync
  docs/       architecture, API, compatibility and sourcing evidence

The engine imports upstream code from exactly one file (engine/src/upstream.ts),
so the boundary between original and derivative work is auditable in a single
grep:

  grep -rn "packages/core" engine/src   # expected: engine/src/upstream.ts only

Files touched outside packages/, all for fork-level housekeeping:

  README.md                       moved to docs/upstream-README.md (content unchanged)
                                  so the front page describes this project
  .github/workflows/release.yml   `paths: '**/package.json'` narrowed to
                                  'package.json' + 'packages/*/package.json', because
                                  engine/package.json would otherwise trigger the
                                  upstream changesets publisher on every engine change

No file under packages/ was edited, deleted or renamed.

